

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:7
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_c68592bb:

    # MC "Markus!"
    MC "¡Markus!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:8
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_f3542d5e:

    # MC "Run! RUN!"
    MC "¡Corre! ¡CORRE!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:9
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_e144dd44:

    # "We sprinted down deeper into the darkness of the unknown, the sounds of metal clanking, beasts snarling, and cries of agony followed behind us."
    "Nos adentramos a toda velocidad en la oscuridad de lo desconocido, detrás de nosotros se oían ruidos metálicos, gruñidos de bestias y gritos de agonía."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:11
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_265a452b:

    # MARKUS "They’re gaining on us!"
    MARKUS "¡Nos están alcanzando!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:12
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_bc178804:

    # MC "Keep running! Don’t stop!"
    MC "¡Sigue corriendo! ¡No te detengas!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:13
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_891fbb8d:

    # MARKUS "But... {b}{i}the others!{/i}{/b}"
    MARKUS "¡Pero... {b}{i}los demás!{/i}{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:14
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_db8ca703:

    # MC "There’s nothing we can do! We have to get to—"
    MC "¡No podemos hacer nada! Tenemos que llegar a—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:17
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_b6fac791:

    # "A Demorai claws its way through the catacomb wall, blocking their path. Standing in front of [player_name!t] and Markus, it snarls savagely."
    "Un demorai se abre paso a través de la pared de la catacumba, bloqueando el camino. De pie frente a [player_name!t] y Markus, gruñe salvajemente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:18
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_3f5de290:

    # MARKUS "L-Look at it!"
    MARKUS "¡M-míralo!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:19
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_91c3f48f:

    # MC "Markus! Draw your sword, damn it!"
    MC "¡Markus! ¡Saca tu espada, maldita sea!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:20
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_a1ddd20f:

    # "Unsheathing his blade with trembling hands, Markus fumbled and dropped it to the floor with a loud clank."
    "Markus desenvainó la espada con manos temblorosas, tanteó y la dejó caer al suelo con un sonoro tintineo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:21
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_a8f4e15d:

    # MARKUS "Sh-Shit!"
    MARKUS "¡M-mierda!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:22
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_aa4f252c:

    # MC "MARKUS!"
    MC "¡MARKUS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:23
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_80342e3b:

    # "The beast charges at Markus, but is suddenly attacked by one of the soldiers fighting the demonic creatures throughout the caves."
    "La bestia carga contra Markus, pero de repente es atacada por uno de los soldados que luchan contra las criaturas demoníacas por todas las cuevas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:26
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_207c971f:

    # SCOUT "Go! GO NOW!"
    SCOUT "¡Id! ¡ID AHORA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:28
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_9fcbf27a:

    # MC "Markus, quickly!"
    MC "¡Markus, rápido!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:29
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_6f2ce96a:

    # MARKUS "Right!"
    MARKUS "¡Vale!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:30
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_71f2a840:

    # "Darting around the battle, we managed to burst our way through into the Forbidden Chamber."
    "Corriendo alrededor de la batalla, nos las arreglamos para abrirnos paso a través de la cámara prohibida."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:31
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_f45bd3a6:

    # MC "Seal the door! SEAL THE FUCKING DOOR!"
    MC "¡Sella la puerta! ¡SELLA LA MALDITA PUERTA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:32
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_473f4bcc:

    # MARKUS "But he—"
    MARKUS "Pero él—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:33
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_b8303e9d:

    # MC "DO IT!"
    MC "¡HAZLO!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:35
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_045294e7:

    # "As Markus moved to try and activate the seal by pulling the strange mechanical levers to our left, I looked up through the deep, seemingly endless darkness of the catacombs."
    "Mientras Markus intentaba activar el sello tirando de las extrañas palancas mecánicas situadas a nuestra izquierda, levanté la vista a través de la profunda y aparentemente interminable oscuridad de las catacumbas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:36
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_ddae734c:

    # "I watched as the monstrosity before me took a hold of the Scout with both of its colossal, wretched, claw like hands and held the flailing man out."
    "Observé cómo la monstruosidad que tenía ante mí agarraba al explorador con sus dos colosales y desdichadas manos, como garras, y sostenía al hombre que se agitaba."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:37
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_cc7a069b:

    # "His cloak flapped helplessly as he swung desperately at the beast, retching up blood, unable to break free from its deathly grip."
    "Su capa se agitó sin poder hacer nada mientras se abalanzaba desesperadamente sobre la bestia, con arcadas de sangre, incapaz de liberarse de su agarre mortal."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:38
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_fa086f51:

    # "The creature relished the moment, feverishly lapping up his blood, snarling in sick pleasure as the Scout croakily managed to cry out."
    "La criatura disfrutó del momento, lamiendo febrilmente su sangre, gruñendo de placer enfermizo cuando el explorador consiguió gritar entre dientes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:38
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_7337b94e:

    # SCOUT "FUCK YOU!"
    SCOUT "¡QUE TE JODAN!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:39
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_bb463d92:

    # SCOUT "I HOPE YOU FUCKING CHO—"
    SCOUT "ESPERO QUE TE ATRA—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:41
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_b3d4450b:

    # "We watched in horror as the beast twisted the body of the man, his cries of pain contorting into an animal like squeal."
    "Contemplamos horrorizados cómo la bestia retorcía el cuerpo del hombre, sus gritos de dolor se transformaron en un chillido animal."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:43
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_2675f8e6:

    # "What followed was a terrible snapping as he tore the body in two, flinging the man’s halves aside."
    "Lo que siguió fue un terrible chasquido al partir el cuerpo en dos, arrojando a un lado las mitades del hombre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:44
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_81cfc0fe:

    # "Behind it, barely visible was a myriad of other monsters, clawing and clambering their way down towards us."
    "Detrás de él, apenas visible, había una miríada de otros monstruos que descendían arañando y trepando hacia nosotros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:45
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_ddba1310:

    # MC "Markus... hurry."
    MC "Markus... date prisa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:46
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_463d4592:

    # "The beast roared and charged at us once again! A behemoth of tooth and claw, galloping, ready."
    "La bestia rugió y cargó contra nosotros una vez más. Un monstruo de dientes y garras, galopando."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:48
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_4170c645:

    # MC "HURRY!"
    MC "¡RÁPIDO!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:49
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_7ad62c8c:

    # MARKUS "It won’t close!"
    MARKUS "¡No se cierra!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:50
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_d7589ccf:

    # MC "CLOSE IT! CLOSE THE FUCKING DOOR!"
    MC "¡CIÉRRALA! ¡CIERRA LA PUTA PUERTA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:52
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_ef27cd89:

    # MARKUS "I’m trying!"
    MARKUS "¡Lo estoy intentando!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:53
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_2cd10d35:

    # MC "MARKUS! HURRY! IT’S NEARLY—"
    MC "¡MARKUS! ¡DATE PRISA! ESTÁ CASI—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:70
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_135591ef:

    # MC "Ah... Today’s the day... {i}Terminus Ceremony.{/i}"
    MC "Ah... Hoy es el día... {i}la ceremonia terminus{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:71
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_3b92041f:

    # "Rising from my bed, I was hit by a {i}shockwave{/i}."
    "Al levantarme de la cama, me golpeó una {i}onda expansiva{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:72
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_7ae716df:

    # MC "Urgh... {i}My head...{/i}"
    MC "Urgh... {i}Mi cabeza...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:73
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_b98a473f:

    # MC "Why did I let Markus talk me into drinking so much last night?"
    MC "¿Por qué dejé que Markus me convenciera de beber tanto anoche?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:74
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_47517399:

    # MC "Well, better get ready."
    MC "Bueno, será mejor que me prepare."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:75
translate es qst_Terminus_intro_19314b42:

    # MC "I should grab some gold before I head out, it is {i}a ceremony{/i} after all."
    MC "Debería coger algo de oro antes de salir, después de todo es {i}una ceremonia{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:86
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_d39399b8:

    # "Hm... Where is everyone?"
    "Hm... ¿Dónde está todo el mundo?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:87
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_232c2f5f:

    # "Looks like Regina is in her room."
    "Parece que Regina está en su habitación."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:88
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_4ce9008c:

    # "...Should I?"
    "...¿Debería?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:90
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_7aa86cfe:

    # MC "...Should I?" nointeract
    MC "...¿Debería?" nointeract

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:89
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c3e50393:

    # "Leaning in, I peered through the small gap in the door to watch as [regina_ref!t] was getting dressed, bare naked as she hummed happily to herself, slowly moving to put on her dress for the morning."
    "Inclinándome, miré a través del pequeño espacio en la puerta para ver como [regina_ref!t] se vestía, completamente desnuda mientras tarareaba alegremente para sí misma, moviéndose lentamente para ponerse su vestido para la mañana."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:96
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_8060ab4f:

    # MC "I... I shouldn’t watch this! This is... {i}perverse{/i}."
    MC "Yo... ¡Yo no debería ver esto! Esto es... {i}perverso{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:97
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_a8c437e9:

    # MC "... But she does look {i}really{/i} pretty."
    MC "...Pero ella se ve {i}realmente{/i} guapa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:93
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c5430cc0:

    # MC "Gah! What’s wrong with me? It’s [regina_ref!t] for Rohark’s sake!"
    MC "¡Ah! ¿Qué me pasa? ¡Es [regina_ref!t] por el amor de Rohark!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:103
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_2403981d:

    # MC "No, of course I’m not gonna do that! What the hell am I even thinking?"
    MC "¡No, claro que no voy a hacer eso! ¿En qué demonios estoy pensando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:104
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_788ecab3:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Well, good morning [player_name!t]."
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "Bueno, buenos días [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:109
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_3525008c:

    # "Following the death of both Erika’s mother and my own due to winter fever, our fathers were sent to the front."
    "Tras la muerte de la madre de Erika y la mía a causa de la fiebre invernal, nuestros padres fueron enviados al frente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:110
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_42b425f3:

    # "Regina, a friend to both families agreed to look after us till our respective fathers came home from the war."
    "Regina, una amiga de ambas familias, aceptó cuidarnos hasta que nuestros respectivos padres regresaran de la guerra."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:107
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_30cb1de3:

    # "Sadly, Erika’s father perished two years ago in battle, leaving [regina_ref!t] and myself the closest thing to family she had left."
    "Por desgracia, el padre de Erika pereció hace dos años en combate, dejándonos a [regina_ref!t] y a mí lo más parecido a una familia que le quedaba."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:112
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_feb83ee4:

    # MC "Erika! I wasn’t expecting you to be here today!"
    MC "¡Erika! ¡No esperaba que estuvieras aquí hoy!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:113
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_6f2e862b:

    # MC "Aren’t you supposed to be on top secret Inquisitor work?"
    MC "¿No se supone que deberías estar haciendo el trabajo de alto secreto de inquisidor?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:114
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c8360b21:

    # ERIKA @ talk "I couldn’t miss seeing you on your big day."
    ERIKA @ talk "No podía perderme verte en tu gran día."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:115
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_91f2bc0b:

    # MC "You didn’t need to come but it means the world to me that you have."
    MC "No era necesario que vinieras, pero significa mucho para mí que lo hayas hecho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:116
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_650e053a:

    # "Erika, thanks to her outstanding grades and increasing aptitude for magic, was snatched up and positioned with the Inquisitors on her final schooling day."
    "Erika, gracias a sus sobresalientes notas y a su creciente aptitud para la magia, fue arrebatada y colocada con los inquisidores en su último día de clase."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:117
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f0e4df88:

    # "I must admit, I missed her deeply as she went off, gallivanting around on great adventures..."
    "Debo admitir que la eché mucho de menos cuando se marchó a vivir grandes aventuras..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:118
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_41ebf0a9:

    # "But I knew the work she did was particularly important, so I was always proud of her."
    "Pero sabía que el trabajo que hacía era especialmente importante, así que siempre me sentí orgullosa de ella."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:119
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_d146fea1:

    # "Now dressed, [regina_ref!t] stepped out into the hallway, gasping with delight once she saw Erika."
    "Ya vestida, [regina_ref!t] salió al pasillo, jadeando de alegría en cuanto vio a Erika."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:120
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c77314f7:

    # REGINA @ talk "[player_name!t], I hope you haven’t—"
    REGINA @ talk "[player_name!t], espero que no—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:124
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_3dc6f6d9:

    # REGINA @ shock_talk "Erika!"
    REGINA @ shock_talk "¡Erika!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:122
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_9166de94:

    # ERIKA @ smile_talk "Hello, [regina_ref!t]."
    ERIKA @ smile_talk "Hola, [regina_ref!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:126
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_c6e8ca81:

    # REGINA @ smile_talk "Oooh! Come here, my love!"
    REGINA @ smile_talk "¡Oooh! ¡Ven aquí, mi amor!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:128
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_edd7277b:

    # "[regina_ref_cap!t] darted over to give Erika a hug, squeezing her tightly, which Erika clearly found a little uncomfortable."
    "[regina_ref_cap!t] se abalanzó sobre Erika para darle un abrazo, apretándola con fuerza, lo que a Erika le resultó claramente un poco incómodo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:129
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_2133ccb1:

    # ERIKA @ surp_talk "Uhh, [regina_ref!t]?"
    ERIKA @ surp_talk "Uhh, ¿[regina_ref!t]?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:133
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_83439c50:

    # ERIKA @ surp_talk "Can’t... {i}breathe!{/i}"
    ERIKA @ surp_talk "¡No puedo... {i}respirar!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:134
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_5b0fac1a:

    # REGINA @ shy_talk "Oh! Sorry, dear!"
    REGINA @ shy_talk "¡Oh! ¡Lo siento, cariño!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:137
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_f5edd23e:

    # REGINA @ smile_talk "I can’t believe you’re already eighteen."
    REGINA @ smile_talk "No puedo creer que ya tengas dieciocho años."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:138
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_88b2e62e:

    # REGINA @ smile_talk "Your father would be so proud!"
    REGINA @ smile_talk "¡Tu padre estaría muy orgulloso!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:136
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_d8c4e46b:

    # MC "Thanks, [regina_ref!t]."
    MC "Gracias, [regina_ref!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:140
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_e0dadf01:

    # MC "... Is there any news on Father?"
    MC "...¿Hay noticias de padre?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:142
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_b8e7f843:

    # REGINA @ talk "... Well..."
    REGINA @ talk "...Bueno..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:144
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_8bbedfc6:

    # REGINA @ sad_talk "No, but..."
    REGINA @ sad_talk "No, pero..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:145
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_aa290b42:

    # MC sad "..."
    MC sad "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:147
translate es qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_76751a70:

