# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:359
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_045c8eab:

    # "Interrupting us, the crowd suddenly roared with cheers as Queen Adelaide and King Mesamor came to the podium, smiling and waving down at us in their luxurious royal wear, their arrogant son absent as usual."
    "Al interrumpirnos, la multitud rugió repentinamente con vítores cuando la reina Adelaida y el rey Mesamor subieron al estrado, sonriendo y saludándonos con sus lujosas ropas reales, su arrogante hijo ausente como de costumbre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:360
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_1394dc9c:

    # "The Queen was a beauty, there was no doubt about that. Many a crude joke had been told in private amongst boys wishing they were her personal squires, helping to {i}tend to ALL her needs...{/i}"
    "La Reina era una belleza, de eso no cabía duda. Muchos chistes groseros se habían contado en privado entre muchachos que deseaban ser sus escuderos personales, ayudando a {i}atender TODAS sus necesidades...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:361
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0ce3c759:

    # "She was a woman who was respected, but she was not loved."
    "Era una mujer respetada, pero no amada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:362
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_65b84426:

    # "She did send money towards charity endeavours such as orphanages, but rarely wanted to be seen by the common people unless some official decorum demanded it, such as this occasion."
    "Enviaba dinero a obras de caridad, como orfanatos, pero rara vez quería ser vista por el pueblo llano, a menos que algún decoro oficial lo exigiera, como en esta ocasión."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:363
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6590881b:

    # "Thankfully, she did not rule alone."
    "Afortunadamente, no gobernaba sola."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:364
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_0eb08be8:

    # "The King smiled, but his eyes were heavy, after all, it had been several years since he’d been deposed in 1156 by our ‘Emperor,’ and he now occupied only a figurehead position..."
    "El rey sonrió, pero sus ojos estaban pesados, después de todo, habían pasado varios años desde que había sido depuesto en 1156 por nuestro ‘Emperador’, y ahora solo ocupaba un puesto de figura..."
# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:365
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_304f39b7:

    # "{i}But...{/i} despite this, he remained popular amongst the people, a symbol of the will to keep persevering in the fight against the Demorai... even though he now had only a shadow of his former power."
    "{i}Pero...{/i} a pesar de ello, seguía siendo popular entre el pueblo, un símbolo de la voluntad de seguir perseverando en la lucha contra los demorai... aunque ahora solo tuviera una sombra de su antiguo poder."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:366
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_5c0c262d:

    # "{i}Ironic,{/i} given that at the time the people would have had his head on a stick for his handling of the war."
    "{i}Irónico,{/i} dado que en aquel momento la gente habría puesto su cabeza en un palo por su gestión de la guerra."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:367
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_206a036b:

    # "I guess that time allows people to romanticise anyone if enough of it goes by."
    "Supongo que el tiempo permite a la gente idealizar a cualquiera si pasa el tiempo suficiente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:368
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_b2159af0:

    # ADARA @ talk "Where’s the Princess? Can you see her?"
    ADARA @ talk "¿Dónde está la princesa? ¿Puedes verla?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:369
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_cd8ebdee:

    # MC "No, is she—"
    MC "No, es ella—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:364
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_06b7173d:

    # RANDOM_MAN "LOOK! IT’S THE PRINCESS!"
    RANDOM_MAN "¡MIRAD! ¡ES LA PRINCESA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:374
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9988f46e:

    # "Nervously stepping out onto the balcony, the beautiful Princess Cecilia smiled and waved at the crowds timidly. Adored and loved by all, {i}the realm’s Princess{/i} was renowned for her charitable and kind nature."
    "Nerviosamente asomada al balcón, la bella princesa Cecilia sonrió y saludó tímidamente a la multitud. Adorada y querida por todos, {i}la princesa del reino{/i} era famosa por su carácter caritativo y bondadoso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:375
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_120bafa6:

    # "I don’t think there was a single hot-blooded male that hadn’t dreamed about her at some point or another, me and Markus included."
    "No creo que hubiera un solo hombre de sangre caliente que no hubiera soñado con ella en algún momento, Markus y yo incluidos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:376
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2eff982e:

    # "I must have had a thousand dreams where I climbed into her chambers through a window and we stole away together and—"
    "Debo haber tenido mil sueños en los que entraba en su habitación por una ventana y nos escapábamos juntos y—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:382
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9441240c:

    # "Markus reappeared from the crowd and playfully grabbed my shoulder, squeezing it tightly as he leaned over to speak in my ear."
    "Markus reapareció entre la multitud y me agarró juguetonamente del hombro, apretándolo con fuerza mientras se inclinaba para hablarme al oído."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:383
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_cd3b5f70:

    # MARKUS "So, when we get to the Royal Court, which one you chasing?"
    MARKUS "Entonces, cuando lleguemos a la corte real, ¿a cuál perseguirás?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:384
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_10a2efba:

    # ADARA @ shock "Markus!"
    ADARA @ shock "¡Markus!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:379
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_6c35cf3a:

    # MARKUS "What? Come onnnn, it’s just a little fun, right, [player_name!t]?"
    MARKUS "¿Qué? Vamossss, es solo una pequeña broma, ¿verdad, [player_name!t]?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:386
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_7b6a0436:

    # ADARA @ angry "The royal family is our oldest and most respected institute!"
    ADARA @ angry "¡La familia real es nuestro instituto más antiguo y respetado!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:387
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_7e78cf25:

    # MARKUS "The royal family is comprised of women prettier than the most expensive whores in the land!"
    MARKUS "¡La familia real está compuesta por mujeres más guapas que las putas más caras del país!"

