    # MARKUS "WAIT A COUPLE YEARS AND HE’LL BE INTERESTED IN THAT WRINKLY—"
    MARKUS "ESPERA UN PAR DE AÑOS Y SE INTERESARÁ POR ESE ARRUGADO—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:419
translate es qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_3ad6dfd4:

    # "Adara slapped Markus across his face, leaving a stinging red mark in its wake." with flash
